(Welcome to Kestrel Labs) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This handbook explains how we work, what you can expect from Kestrel Labs, and what we) Tj T*
(expect from you. It applies to all full-time and part-time employees. If something here) Tj T*
(conflicts with your employment contract, the contract wins.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Questions about any policy go to the People team at people@kestrel.example. Policies are) Tj T*
(reviewed every January and the current version is always the one on the intranet.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
