(Working hours and remote work) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Our core hours are 11:00 to 15:00 in your local time zone. Outside core hours you can) Tj T*
(arrange your day as you like, as long as your team knows when to reach you.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Employees may work remotely up to three days per week. Remote days must be agreed with) Tj T*
(your manager at least one week in advance and recorded in the team calendar.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Employees who live more than 80 kilometres from an office can apply to work fully) Tj T*
(remotely. Fully remote employees travel to an office for a team week once every quarter,) Tj T*
(and Kestrel Labs pays for the travel.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
