(Leave) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Full-time employees receive 24 days of paid annual leave per year, plus public holidays.) Tj T*
(Part-time employees receive leave in proportion to their contracted hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Up to five unused days can be carried over into the next year. Carried-over days must be) Tj T*
(used by 31 March, after which they expire.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Sick leave is separate from annual leave. Tell your manager before 10:00 on the first) Tj T*
(day of illness. A doctor's note is needed for absences longer than five working days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Parents receive 20 weeks of fully paid parental leave, which can be taken at any time in) Tj T*
(the first year after the birth or adoption of a child.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
