(Equipment and expenses) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Every employee receives a laptop and a home-office budget of 600 dollars, which can be) Tj T*
(spent on a desk, chair, monitor or headset in the first three months of employment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Submit expense claims with a receipt in the finance portal within 30 days of the) Tj T*
(purchase. Claims older than 90 days cannot be reimbursed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Any single purchase above 500 dollars, including travel, needs approval from your) Tj T*
(department head before you pay. Book flights in economy class for trips shorter than six) Tj T*
(hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
