(Learning and development) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Each employee has a yearly learning budget of 1,500 dollars for courses, books and) Tj T*
(conferences. Unused budget does not carry over to the next year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(You can spend up to four working days per year at conferences or training without using) Tj T*
(annual leave. Agree the dates with your manager at least two weeks before.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(After two years at Kestrel Labs you can apply for a paid sabbatical of up to four weeks) Tj T*
(to work on a project that develops your skills.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
